  <p>
    <strong>Activewear sizing and grading</strong> are where a promising yoga legging, sports bra or matching set becomes a product that customers can actually wear with confidence. A visual reference may show the intended silhouette, but it cannot define how the waistband holds, where a bra underband sits, how a rise feels in a squat or whether a size L keeps the same product promise as a size S.
